//! Rust port of the NClientV3 portable core.
//!
//! Source of truth: `../NClientV3/app/src/main/java/com/maxwai/nclientv3/`
//! (`api` package + `utility/Utility.java` pure logic).
//!
//! Parity contract: every public function mirrors the Java behavior *including
//! its quirks* (documented at each site). Golden outputs generated by running
//! the original Java logic on a JVM live in `../java-goldens/goldens.json` and
//! are enforced by `tests/parity.rs`.
//!
//! Not ported (Android-only, no Rust analogue): Activities/adapters/views,
//! Parcelable, Android `JsonReader` plumbing (replaced by serde_json with
//! identical key handling), SQLite `Queries.*` (replaced by a `TagProvider`
//! trait), image/cache/file layers, OkHttp client (caller supplies HTTP).

